herence to\",\"our standards\":\"our standards\",\"just now\":\"just now\",\"Last updated: {{replacer}}\":\"Last updated: {{replacer}}\",\"Latest Videos\":\"Latest Videos\",\"Instrument\":\"Instrument\",\"Exchange\":\"Exchange\",\"Benchmark Data\":\"Benchmark Data\",\"24h Change\":\"24h Change\",\"24h Volume\":\"24h Volume\",\"Direct Vol.\":\"Direct Vol.\",\"Top Tier Vol.\":\"Top Tier Vol.\",\"Last 7 Days\":\"Last 7 Days\",\"Company\":\"Company\",\"Total Volume\":\"Total Volume\",\"24h Change %\":\"24h Change %\",\"P/E\":\"P/E\",\"EPS\":\"EPS\",\"equities.tooltip.pe\":\"Price-to-earnings ratio. The share price divided by earnings per share — a measure of how much investors pay for each dollar of company earnings.\",\"equities.tooltip.eps\":\"Earnings per share. The company's net profit divided by its number of outstanding shares — a measure of per-share profitability.\",\"Trading Pair\":\"Trading Pair\",\"Benchmark Score\":\"Benchmark Score\",\"24h Trades\":\"24h Trades\",\"24h Open\":\"24h Open\",\"24h High\":\"24h High\",\"Filters\":\"Filters\",\"Crypto\":\"Crypto\",\"faq.what_is.question\":\"What is {{replacer}}?\",\"faq.what_is.answer\":\"{{replacer}} is a cryptocurrency that operates on a decentralized blockchain network. It can be used for peer-to-peer transactions, as a store of value, or for various applications within its ecosystem.\",\"faq.who_created.question\":\"Who created {{replacer}}?\",\"faq.who_created.answer\":\"{{replacer}} was created by its founding team and developers. For detailed information about the project's origins and team, please refer to the official documentation and whitepaper.\",\"faq.how_to_buy.question\":\"How do I buy {{replacer}}?\",\"faq.how_to_buy.answer\":\"You can buy {{replacer}} on various cryptocurrency exchanges. First, create an account on a reputable exchange, complete the verification process, deposit funds, and then place an order for {{replacer}}.\",\"faq.is_good_investment.question\":\"Is {{replacer}} a good investment?\",\"faq.is_good_investment.answer\":\"The value of {{replacer}}, like all cryptocurrencies, can be volatile. Before investing, research thoroughly, understand the risks, and never invest more than you can afford to lose. Consider consulting a financial advisor.\",\"faq.how_to_store.question\":\"How do I store {{replacer}}?\",\"faq.how_to_store.answer\":\"You can store {{replacer}} in cryptocurrency wallets. Options include hardware wallets (most secure for long-term storage), software wallets, and exchange wallets. Always backup your wallet and keep your private keys secure.\",\"faq.what_makes_unique.question\":\"What makes {{replacer}} unique?\",\"faq.what_makes_unique.answer\":\"{{replacer}} has unique features and technology that differentiate it from other cryptocurrencies. These may include its consensus mechanism, transaction speed, scalability solutions, or specific use cases within its ecosystem.\",\"faq.current_price.question\":\"What is the current price of {{replacer}}?\",\"faq.current_price.answer\":\"The current price of {{replacer}} is displayed at the top of this page and updates in real-time. You can also view historical price charts and market data including 24-hour trading volume and market capitalization.\",\"faq.how_network_secured.question\":\"How is the {{replacer}} network secured?\",\"faq.how_network_secured.answer\":\"The {{replacer}} network is secured through its consensus mechanism, which may include Proof of Work, Proof of Stake, or other validation methods. This ensures transaction integrity and prevents double-spending.\",\"breadcrumb.home\":\"CoinDesk\",\"breadcrumb.prices\":\"Prices\",\"price today\":\"price today\",\"to USD live price, marketcap and chart\":\"to USD live price, marketcap and chart\",\"Make us preferred on Google\":\"Make us preferred on Google\",\"Circ. / Total / Max\":\"Circ. / Total / Max\",\"Charts\":\"Charts\",\"Open\":\"Open\",\"High\":\"High\",\"Low\":\"Low\",\"Close\":\"Close\",\"Exchange Benchmark\":\"