tential investors gauge the stability and potential growth of digital assets like bitcoin and ether. CoinDesk's list provides real-time data insights into transaction volume over the last 24 hours — a possible indicator of a digital asset's market activity, investor interest, and liquidity.\",\"Gainers\":\"Gainers\",\"Losers\":\"Losers\",\"Categories\":\"Categories\",\"Stablecoin\":\"Stablecoin\",\"NFT\":\"NFT\",\"Meme\":\"Meme\",\"Governance\":\"Governance\",\"Platform\":\"Platform\",\"Payment\":\"Payment\",\"Wrapped\":\"Wrapped\",\"Research Reports\":\"Research Reports\",\"Featured\":\"Featured\",\"View all Research\":\"View all Research\",\"View all News\":\"View all News\",\"Data \u0026 Indices\":\"Data \u0026 Indices\",\"Market Data\":\"Market Data\",\"Unrivaled digital asset data for institutional analysis and insights.\":\"Unrivaled digital asset data for institutional analysis and insights.\",\"Index Offering\":\"Index Offering\",\"Discover our index offerings with $49 billion in benchmarked assets, trusted by 100+ global partners.\":\"Discover our index offerings with $49 billion in benchmarked assets, trusted by 100+ global partners.\",\"Institutional-grade crypto data streamed live from 300+ exchanges.\":\"Institutional-grade crypto data streamed live from 300+ exchanges.\",\"Research Insights\":\"Research Insights\",\"Data-driven analysis of key digital asset trends.\":\"Data-driven analysis of key digital asset trends.\",\"Documentation and Governance\":\"Documentation and Governance\",\"Index methodologies, policies, announcements and updates.\":\"Index methodologies, policies, announcements and updates.\",\"Make {{replacer}} preferred on {{replacer}}\":\"Make {{replacer}} preferred on {{replacer}}\",\"Updated\":\"Updated\",\"1 minute ago\":\"1 minute ago\",\"{{replacer}} minutes ago\":\"{{replacer}} minutes ago\",\"1 hour ago\":\"1 hour ago\",\"{{replacer}} hours ago\":\"{{replacer}} hours ago\",\"1 day ago\":\"1 day ago\",\"{{replacer}} days ago\":\"